{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55587","headline":"偈 二 · 德谦","name":"偈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓦刀丛里逞全威，汝等应当（《五灯会元》作「诸人」）善护持。\n火里铁牛生犊子，临歧谁解凑吾机。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十三、《五灯会元》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}